<title>USA: Magna to list on New York Stock Exchange.</title>
<headline>Magna to list on New York Stock Exchange.</headline>
<dateline>ST. LOUIS, Mo. 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Magna Group Inc said Friday it filed an application to list its common stock on the New York Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>Magna said it should begin trading on the NYSE by the end of November under the symbol MGR.</p>
<p>&quot;Given Magna's growth and our current market capitalization, we believe this move will better position Magna as a leading financial institution,&quot; G. Thomas Andes, chairman, said in a statement.</p>
<p>Magna has 106 banking locations in Illinois and Missouri, and a trust and brokerage company.</p>
<p>Reuters Chicago Newsdesk - 312-408-8787</p>
